    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "bookkeeping",
      "label": "your state",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Your state:"
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "actions",
      "label": "the offers",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not battle_over"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['deploy ' + c for c in you.hand] + ['improvise ' + c + ' to Air' for c in you.hand] + ['improvise ' + c + ' to Land' for c in you.hand] + ['improvise ' + c + ' to Sea' for c in you.hand] + ['withdraw']"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "actions",
      "label": "first player acts",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not battle_over"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == first_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "a1"
      },
      "text": "You are the first player this round. Choose one action: 'deploy <card>' plays it face-up to its own theater for its number; 'improvise <card> to <theater>' plays it face-down to any theater for +{improvise_strength}; 'withdraw' concedes the battle (your opponent gains {withdraw_vp_4_plus_cards} VP if you hold 4+ cards, {withdraw_vp_2_or_3_cards} VP if 2 or 3, {withdraw_vp_1_card} VP if 1)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "actions",
      "label": "first player's action resolves",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not battle_over"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_kind",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'withdraw' if $a1 == 'withdraw' else ('deploy' if $a1 in ['deploy ' + c for c in players[first_seat - 1].hand] else 'improvise')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "([c for c in players[first_seat - 1].hand if $a1 in ['deploy ' + c, 'improvise ' + c + ' to Air', 'improvise ' + c + ' to Land', 'improvise ' + c + ' to Sea']] + [''])[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_theater",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(('Air' if act_card[0] == 'A' else ('Land' if act_card[0] == 'L' else 'Sea')) if act_kind == 'deploy' else ('Air' if $a1 == 'improvise ' + act_card + ' to Air' else ('Land' if $a1 == 'improvise ' + act_card + ' to Land' else 'Sea')))"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(act_card[-1]) if act_kind == 'deploy' else improvise_strength"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "vp",
            "value": {
              "calc": "withdraw_vp_1_card if len(players[first_seat - 1].hand) == 1 else (withdraw_vp_2_or_3_cards if len(players[first_seat - 1].hand) <= 3 else withdraw_vp_4_plus_cards)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'withdraw'"
            },
            "text": "Seat {first_seat} withdraws from battle {battle}. Seat {player} gains VP for the withdrawal."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "battle_over",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'deploy'"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} deploys {act_card} face-up to {act_theater} (+{act_gain})."
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "face_down",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card + ' to ' + act_theater"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'improvise'"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} improvises a face-down card to {act_theater} (+{improvise_strength})."
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "down_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'improvise'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "air",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw' and act_theater == 'Air'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "land",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw' and act_theater == 'Land'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "sea",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw' and act_theater == 'Sea'"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "actions",
      "label": "the second offer",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not battle_over"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['deploy ' + c for c in you.hand] + ['improvise ' + c + ' to Air' for c in you.hand] + ['improvise ' + c + ' to Land' for c in you.hand] + ['improvise ' + c + ' to Sea' for c in you.hand] + ['withdraw']"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "actions",
      "label": "second player acts",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not battle_over"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != first_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "a2"
      },
      "text": "You are the second player this round. Choose one action: 'deploy <card>' plays it face-up to its own theater for its number; 'improvise <card> to <theater>' plays it face-down to any theater for +{improvise_strength}; 'withdraw' concedes the battle (your opponent gains {withdraw_vp_4_plus_cards} VP if you hold 4+ cards, {withdraw_vp_2_or_3_cards} VP if 2 or 3, {withdraw_vp_1_card} VP if 1)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "actions",
      "label": "second player's action resolves",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not battle_over"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_kind",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'withdraw' if $a2 == 'withdraw' else ('deploy' if $a2 in ['deploy ' + c for c in players[2 - first_seat].hand] else 'improvise')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "([c for c in players[2 - first_seat].hand if $a2 in ['deploy ' + c, 'improvise ' + c + ' to Air', 'improvise ' + c + ' to Land', 'improvise ' + c + ' to Sea']] + [''])[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_theater",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(('Air' if act_card[0] == 'A' else ('Land' if act_card[0] == 'L' else 'Sea')) if act_kind == 'deploy' else ('Air' if $a2 == 'improvise ' + act_card + ' to Air' else ('Land' if $a2 == 'improvise ' + act_card + ' to Land' else 'Sea')))"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_gain",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(act_card[-1]) if act_kind == 'deploy' else improvise_strength"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "first_seat"
            },
            "key": "vp",
            "value": {
              "calc": "withdraw_vp_1_card if len(players[2 - first_seat].hand) == 1 else (withdraw_vp_2_or_3_cards if len(players[2 - first_seat].hand) <= 3 else withdraw_vp_4_plus_cards)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'withdraw'"
            },
            "text": "The second player withdraws from battle {battle}. Seat {player} gains VP for the withdrawal."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "battle_over",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'deploy'"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} deploys {act_card} face-up to {act_theater} (+{act_gain})."
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "face_down",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card + ' to ' + act_theater"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'improvise'"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} improvises a face-down card to {act_theater} (+{improvise_strength})."
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "down_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind == 'improvise'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "air",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw' and act_theater == 'Air'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "land",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw' and act_theater == 'Land'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - first_seat"
            },
            "key": "sea",
            "value": {
              "calc": "act_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "act_kind != 'withdraw' and act_theater == 'Sea'"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "battle end",
      "label": "battle end",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_battle == rounds_per_battle and not battle_over"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "s1_theaters",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(1 if (players[0].air > players[1].air or (players[0].air == players[1].air and first_seat == 1)) else 0) + (1 if (players[0].land > players[1].land or (players[0].land == players[1].land and first_seat == 1)) else 0) + (1 if (players[0].sea > players[1].sea or (players[0].sea == players[1].sea and first_seat == 1)) else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "battle_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if s1_theaters >= theaters_to_win_battle else 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "battle_winner"
            },
            "key": "vp",
            "value": {
              "calc": "battle_win_vp"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "battle_over",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Battle {battle} ends. Seat 1 controls {s1_theaters} of {theaters} theaters (ties go to seat {first_seat}). Seat {battle_winner} wins the battle and gains {battle_win_vp} VP."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "next round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.vp",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final VP: Seat 1 {players[0].vp}, Seat 2 {players[1].vp}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 25,
    "rounds_max": 25,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "CARDS. There are {total_cards} cards: Air 1-6, Land 1-6 and Sea 1-6. A card's strength is its number ({min_strength} to {max_strength}).\n\nMATCH. The match has {total_rounds} rounds, grouped into {battles} battles of {rounds_per_battle} rounds: battle 1 is rounds 1-6, battle 2 rounds 7-12, battle 3 rounds 13-18, battle 4 rounds 19-24. Seat 1 is the first player in battles 1 and 3; seat 2 is the first player in battles 2 and 4.\n\nBATTLE START. At the first round of each battle, every player's Air, Land and Sea strength is reset to 0 and all played cards are cleared. All {total_cards} cards are shuffled, {hand_size} are dealt privately to each player's hand, and the remaining {set_aside_count} are put aside unseen, out of play for this battle.\n\nACTIONS. If the battle is not over, the first player takes one action. Then, if the battle is still not over, the second player takes one action. An action is exactly one of:\n(a) DEPLOY: play a card from your hand face-up to the theater named on it. Add its number to your strength there.\n(b) IMPROVISE: play a card from your hand face-down to any theater. Add {improvise_strength} to your strength there. The opponent sees only the theater and the +{improvise_strength}, not the card.\n(c) WITHDRAW: concede the battle.\nAll theater strengths and face-up cards are public. Hands, the set-aside cards and the identity of face-down cards are hidden.\n\nWITHDRAWAL. When a player withdraws, count the cards left in their hand. The opponent immediately gains VP: 4 or more cards gives {withdraw_vp_4_plus_cards} VP; 2 or 3 cards gives {withdraw_vp_2_or_3_cards} VP; 1 card gives {withdraw_vp_1_card} VP. The battle is over at once. If the first player withdrew, the second player does not act that round. Every remaining round of the battle passes with no actions and no scoring, and the next battle starts at its fixed round as usual. If nobody withdraws, the battle runs to its last round.\n\nBATTLE END. After both actions in the last round of a battle that is not over, both hands are empty. In each theater, the player with the higher strength controls it; a tie goes to that battle's first player. The player who controls {theaters_to_win_battle} or more theaters wins the battle and gains {battle_win_vp} VP; the other player gains nothing.\n\nEND. After round {total_rounds} the game ends. The player with more VP wins. Equal VP is a draw, and both players share the win."
}
